{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/trouble-tickets/1520279-can-we-chill-on-the-edit-spam-bug-posts","id":1520279,"title":"Can we chill on the edit spam bug posts?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Trouble Tickets"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-10T03:30:27-07:00","id":1520279,"title":"Can we chill on the edit spam bug posts?","content":"Folks, I get it, it's frustrating. It's frustrating for me too.<br /> <br /> But we have five threads about it. The <b>volunteers</b> running this forum in their free time know. They're doing what they can. Flooding this forum with new threads, new complaints, and so on is just going to burn the admin and mod teams out. They endured years of constant complaining about how busted the forums were, and the praise for finally getting it working was short lived and is now completely dead because of a single bug that we all know about now. <br /> <br /> If you were doing something completely for free, that lots and lots of people enjoy, but all you get out of it is a bunch of threads about a problem that you've already said what you can say about... you wouldn't want to bother responding to it all. You'd want to consider if this is really worth your time at all.<br /> <br /> Nobody likes the bug. But it's not getting fixed faster if it's a more popular topic than most of the games. It's just going to be something, at best, nobody on the forum team is going to respond to because there's no point until there's a real solution. At worst, we're harming their motivation to care. Again, they're volunteers trying to make our lives more fun. We don't need to ruin their time here over our posts having some typos in it, or having to make a second post instead of editing in things to and existing one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-25T04:44:07-07:00","id":1521371,"title":"","content":"Appreciate this.<br /> <br /> Additionally, flag reports appear to us in the same place as things that are caught in the spam filter so flagging a stuck post to get our attention is just stuffing the flag reports full of problems we're already aware of and actually delays us from acting on potential misconduct. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-27T11:04:10-07:00","id":1523223,"title":"","content":"Opps I got flagged by the edit gods for trying to improve on my last post.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude21","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-18T16:42:11-08:00","id":1525615,"title":"","content":"It would help if someone would bother to actually spell out everything that trips the spam filter/unauthorized content problem.<br /> <br /> We know actually trying to edit posts - even hours or days after the original post - does it. <br /> <br /> A list of what words, phrases, and other things we need to avoid to actually be able to post on this board would be helpful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-19T01:16:25-08:00","id":1525626,"title":"","content":"I doubt it's the simple, or the mods would have already done something like that. If it was just editing specific words/phrases it should be a very easy problem to fix. The number of different posters with different posting styles that get hit with it implies something deeper in the algorithm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-11T15:31:09-07:00","id":1540184,"title":"","content":"I tested another hypothesis about the system today. After logging out and then logging back in after about an hour or two, I was apparently able to edit without the need for approval. It may just be keyed to login session.<br /> <br /> Edit: You don't even need to wait. It's entirely keyed into your login session, so ending one and starting another will allow you to edit without need of mod approval.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","user":"Saur Ops Specialist","date":". 09-08-2024, 01:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}